      "text": "Abram went down into Egypt, Gen. 12:10. they brought Joseph into Egypt, Gen. 37:28. ten brethren went down to buy corn in Egypt, Gen. 42:3. came into Egypt, Jacob, and all his seed, Gen. 46:6. affliction of my people … in Egypt, Ex. 3:7 (Acts 7:34). Lord brought us out from Egypt, Ex. 13:14. bring them out of the land of Egypt, Jer. 31:32 (Heb. 8:9). carry captives into Egypt their gods, Dan. 11:8. called my son out of Egypt, Hosea 11:1 (Matt. 2:15). Egypt shall be a desolation, Joel 3:19.",
